  "details": "It seems, the current Version of Windows 11 25H2 or rather the current Version of Smart App Control, seems to block the GameAssembly.dll from VRChat, causing the Client to crash and Fatal Error, I dont know if it only happens in the open-beta as I currently run the Unity 6 Beta, but its something that I thought should be reported.\n\nIf it helps the Message from Smart Control was \"Could not determine Creator Origin, file was blocked to prevent potential harm to the System.\"",
